Layered translucent planes of dark smoked glass floating at gentle angles over a near-black #0A0A0C void, each edge catching a hair-thin line of electric blue #4F83FF rim light from the left. Deep midnight navy shadows sit between the layers, with a soft depth-of-field blur on the outer edges and the upper portion fading to pure black. 8K quality, ultra smooth gradients, premium feel, no text, no letters, no UI elements, no device mockups